OL,3,AUN experts say grounds to believe US
OL,4,Acommitted war crimes in Iran strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US previously denied striking
OL,7,FLamerd and said it was investigating
OL,8,Fwhat happened in Minab. A State
OL,9,FDepartment official said the US did not
OL,10,Fgive credibility to the findings in the
OL,11,Freport.
OL,13,FThe experts also found Iranian
OL,14,Fauthorities committed crimes against
OL,15,Fhumanity during a crackdown on mass
OL,16,Fanti-government protests in January.
